1783671459048081	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExuwQ		item.comment	bn-u6o	{"body":"Implemented all four items in ws bn-u6o (commit b45f7f0f): (1) run_roll_sealer skip is now loud — new seals_skipped counter on SealMetrics/EngineMetrics + rate-limited eprintln in DegradationAlarm style; (2) oversized-batch pre-check via SegmentWriter::empty_segment_capacity — typed SegmentFull returned before any roll, no wasted near-empty segment; (3) Inner::drop publishes a single shared shutdown deadline (EngineOptions::shutdown_seal_budget, default 2s) bounding TOTAL drain wait across all queued seals, skips counted; (4) engine_roll concurrency test switched to tokio multi_thread flavor. Gates: cargo test -p mess-log (all pass incl new oversized-roll unit test), -p mess-store --skip snapshot_plus_tail (all pass incl 2 new white-box skip tests + new integration test), -p mess-index (pass), clippy -p mess-log -p mess-index -p mess-store --all-targets -D warnings clean."}	blake3:9GCqOFzDF--O3Z9egsTxrySEOnHqdWc6Hw02ErxnacE
