1783699030681683	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExvQQ		item.comment	bn-7t1	{"body":"VERIFIED FIXED: maw v1.0.0-pre.11 (installed) contains the bn-rah2 fix — FF-absorb replays committed-ahead siblings via the guarded rebase path, per-sibling NOTEs, no raw HEAD writes; plus bn-3rst (sync refusals name the dirty paths). Empirical verification: waves 15-19 here (~17 merges with committed-ahead siblings present) had zero pointer resets; every sibling auto-rebase was ref-faithful. Closing."}	blake3:aMWZC70KeQn9TABIm8bRffngRBcr8HjD0D9kLQdVoNg
