1783725712132922	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxgU		item.comment	bn-o9z	{"body":"bn-22v handoff: the warm-write flip is yours (all prerequisites landed). Mechanical steps proven by bn-22v: (a) store_backend.rs: Store = EventStore<FjallSnapshotBackend<LogEngine>>; (b) update construction in src/bin/social-web.rs and seed paths (wrap engine in FjallSnapshotBackend); (c) bound seed::generate and the WriteOps blanket impl at B: SnapshotStore; (d) switch WriteOps to command_cached. tests/snapshots.rs already proves cache-on == cache-off results. Measure seed + startup with warm writes on for the README numbers."}	blake3:QPW5K0nViGVSCQeTBXOWWVroyRGPaHz_8D6zLcEhvCM
