1783792741002676	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAg		item.comment	bn-hzc	{"body":"implementation compiles + smoke passes: growth-under-readers 0 violations (A2/A3/A4, 4M streams), loom seqlock model PASS (482s, preempt bound 3), A2 mem 16.02 B/stream measured RSS. AtomicU128 lock-free=true on this host. Running full measurement suite next."}	blake3:QRoRADvb_bW5eRaHOx3SJHD3Lw2tr0Wkv0_-vdVxKQg
1783793515331553	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAw		item.comment	bn-hzc	{"body":"VERDICT: direct pages win, keep-HashMap is off the table. Decision rule PASS: A4 (AtomicU128, lock-free here) under 1 writer p50 70ns/p99 210ns = 46x fjall (3190ns), 2.6x RwLock-HashMap (180ns); 4R+1W throughput 207M uniform / 511M zipf reads/s vs HashMap 3.3M (63-147x). Apply 33-43M cells/s (gate >=20M PASS, A2 30-41M PASS). Resident 16.02 B/stream at 1M AND 10M (gate <=20B PASS; A3 41B FAIL -> rejected). Bounded retry PASS (A2 p99.9 <=1 normal, <=59 pathological; A4 zero retries). Absolute p50<=50/p99<=150 gates fail under-writer for EVERY candidate incl. baselines (~70-100ns cross-core+DRAM floor at 16MB+ footprint); quiet p50 20ns PASSES. Loom PASS on real seqlock fns (482s); 0 torn pairs across all scenarios incl. growth 0->4M under 4 readers. Recommendation: chunked pages w/ A4 cell where AtomicU128 lock-free, A2 seqlock fallback. Full tables in spikes/state_kernel_dense_heads/REPORT.md"}	blake3:C0FyPV6v7cC0lE_MVdsBDQ2Ni90DaAXgbZxgfUfF0r4
1783876880076779	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAQ		item.comment	bn-9mw	{"body":"Codec + golden fixtures done. v4 module (format/control/capsule/recover/writer) compiles clean; tests/v4_golden.rs green (9 tests: every control kind + capsule shape round-trips, split-CRC coverage proven byte-exact, pinned hex fixtures). §23 decisions resolved: 96B header, header_crc dropped->reserved, 32B marker w/ batch_id+total_len+crc echoes, uncompressed controls, all controls critical. Next: recovery/negative tests, exhaustive small-state model, v4 torn matrix, D4 retry tests."}	blake3:l3gOFSVyLe8fkao-P0YvQISjyUpbgbMt94RNma3cM8A
1783877342363351	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAg		item.comment	bn-9mw	{"body":"Model+recovery green. Exhaustive small-state model enumerates 96,654 crash states (Model A all durable-sector subsets 1-2 capsules; Model B 3-capsule prefix+frontier-tear) x {zeros,stale-prior-epoch} bg — ZERO safety violations across P1(no split) P2(no dup/stale batch_id) P3(no gp gap) P4(no advance from control-only) P5(registry-before-use) P6(idempotent) P7(acked-implies-recovered). 20 recovery/negative tests green. Next: v4 torn matrix (512B/4KiB, control+zero-event), fuzz, D4 retry tests in mess-store, scan bench."}	blake3:t-jI0Bu21ebKuMDsKaAKKlbKgq8FKD1oJOn_3X8sXCE
1783878684620378	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAw		item.comment	bn-9mw	{"body":"Torn matrix + D4 + fuzz done. v4 torn matrix: 24k cases 0 violations, CRC differential ~1.6% (matches v3). v3 torn matrix untouched-green. D4 (a)+(b) retry tests green over real RegistryState seam (AlreadyRegistered not weakened). Fuzz: 3 targets (capsule/control/scan) each 10M execs under ASAN, ZERO crashes; seed corpus committed. Next: scan-overhead bench (quiet-guarded) + REPORT + full-workspace test."}	blake3:sbBOYGQX69GpUOhJLm7TbrkM_fmKTTdO3Y6__NyEfvE
1783877477556087	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAQ		item.comment	bn-3of	{"body":"Format + dual-read GREEN. mess-index: pack.rs (typed-section SealPack, blake3 whole-pack hash, per-section crc32c+content_hash_prefix, codec-tagged STREAM_DIRECTORY sorted/bitrank, new EVENT_TYPE_IDS dict section, reserved SEGMENT_EFFECT/etc). SealedSegmentIndex::from_pack reuses the exact sidecar read surface. Driver seal_consolidated: build->verify pointers+payload->fdatasync->rename->dir-fsync->finalize->install. Engine: EngineOptions.seal_pack (default OFF), dual-read load_sealed (.seal preferred, legacy .pidx fallback, Spike C footer-verified vs pending preserved), EVENT_TYPE_IDS wired into cold decode_capsule (skips raw frame decode when section+pcol cover). 122 index unit tests + 4 flag-ON engine tests (byte-identity differential pack-vs-sidecar, reopen, injection matrix, legacy/pack coexistence) green; key flag-OFF suites unregressed."}	blake3:1tx_Pst1F3cmALX2cMNOcIm2pKNCYWjW5PsDjo4tgsY
1783881138248001	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExAg		item.comment	bn-3of	{"body":"FINAL: Spike I ADMIT (behind EngineOptions.seal_pack, default OFF). Gates: byte-identical replay PASS; install states 1 vs 3 PASS; sealed-tier file opens on reopen 153->51 (3->1/seg, -66.7%) PASS; seal wall 1.04x (460us vs 444us mean/seal) PASS; corrupt optional section local-degrade PASS; cold read pack p99 39.7us vs sidecar 45.2us (EVENT_TYPE_IDS fast path skips raw-frame decode) PASS. EVENT_TYPE_IDS = dictionary + width-adaptive indices (1B/event common case, O(1), exact for any universe). Riskiest diff: decode_capsule fully-from-pack fast path bypasses raw-frame identity check (relies on upstream accepted_batch_at CRC + verify-on-seal). 188 sealed+index tests green; commits in workspace (3 logical: index format, engine integration, bench+REPORT). spikes/seal_pack/REPORT.md has full tables. NO push/merge — awaiting adversarial review."}	blake3:XpDaxUSkCLBT1_e1oYY7EKTEF8G0TqIvBumxLaLlUjg
