1783826729002681	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx3QY		item.comment	bn-3fn	{"body":"Spike F (bn-2gg) MERGED — verdict ADOPT-F3 (microblock arena, linear within-block scan, skip chain every 8 blocks, stride-8 sparse global checkpoints). All gates PASS: apply 2.2-5.3x the current ActiveIndex; contended-read p99 90-220ns vs F0's 282us RwLock herd collapse at 64 readers (p99.9 2.9ms -> 720ns); deep resolve p50 70ns via skip chain; global seek 10.9x at 1/20th resident bytes; slab reclaim 378x faster with no reader-visible spike. F2 (binary search in 32-entry blocks) rejected — linear scan wins, research/03 s3.3 confirmed. Carry-forwards for the adopting bone: graduate sparse streams from 4-8-entry first blocks (26% occupancy at sparse Zipf); 40-bit offset deltas if a segment ever spans >4GB offsets; stride-8 global assumes <=7 header scans in page cache — verify in Spike J, stride-1 fallback still 2.8x. WAVE COMPLETE: 9/11 done (0,A,B,C,D,F,G,H). Remaining: E (v4 format kill point, HELD for user go), I (SealPack, unblocked), J (final composed decision, blocked by E+I)."}	blake3:YZAN6Z62dVl4R-8RgOEAZlBqwyRPKxUKGo5VD9nuB84
