1783982500591597	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkAc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Progress: resumed clean workspace; absorbing Spike B/J, current committer/engine flow, and registry ordered-unit invariants before implementation."}	blake3:UEa-m9VcStmBBjJh6QW_7M2M4jJ_r3MrHD7t-PctR9k
1783984369110455	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkQc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Progress: flat owner implemented and focused gates green: exact-version/convoy (including fsync counts and Os sync-per-batch), registry integrity 5/5 including >64MiB new-stream/type repros, name durability 8/8, cancellation 2/2, roll 4/4. Full workspace all-target check green; mess-log full suite 126 pass/1 ignored. Full mess-store suite is still running its known long snapshot law."}	blake3:VKgFTTQ5WSOsGf9nqCTwDBvd6X_XkvtRM5BUKe_JUtw
1783984967228340	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkgc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Verification checkpoint: first MESS_SNAPSHOT_LAW_ITERS=25 just test run reached 375 pass before 3 CLI failures exposed stale assumptions that flat-owner LogEngine creates <dir>/meta. Updated mess-cli metaread to treat absent legacy engine meta as normal/empty while still independently reading .snapshots and still erroring if an existing store is locked/corrupt; targeted doctor_app_snapshots (2), inspect lock-shape (1), doctor_lock_state (3) all pass. Second just test reached 623 pass before the timing-only mess-log fold_chain_overhead test failed under parallel nextest load; isolated rerun passed (714.4ns chain step vs 800.1ns frame hash). Final no-fail-fast workspace run completed all 942: 941 passed, only the same unrelated timing envelope failed under load; differential model passed in 61.236s. Owner-specific checks pass: direct core 3/3, repeated 4-writer convoy 400 batches / 101 fsyncs = 3.96 batches/fsync, workspace all-target check/fmt/diff-check green."}	blake3:d9gyi-YH2urqqcFLUVBiNW0jJ2KuiUN05QNQOGGv6nM
1783984991151787	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExkwc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Review requested: cr-2hjzqz, workspace: bn-2su (.maw/workspaces/bn-2su/). Adversarial brief: REFUTE merge-readiness across durability, registry atomicity, cancellation/publication, D7 fsync convoy, EIO poison, roll/shutdown, and absent derived-meta behavior."}	blake3:h-dKyW9yEaG70aezNNJefT2Oe5AyugY_2gqYZGym69o
1783985423403790	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlAc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Review response b583fd0: restored bn-2ib append-time decoded-capsule write-through warm (retains owned records through ack, inserts DecodedBatch at durable pointer before publish). Updated baseline_matrix's stale v3 registry-position watermark oracle. Full matched matrix restarted; same reviewer re-check requested."}	blake3:KepzDvEvbjDfEEpSQCHJlv1gK4PkTEgwYO2zaDyrhZE
1783986135921535	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlQc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Matched 32-cell post-fix matrix complete (release, ABBA, median-of-3, quiet guard <6). Evidence committed as spikes/baseline_matrix/BN-2SU-REPORT.md (2a56889). D7 convoy fix confirmed: stable 4w log/bare fsyncs about 803/801, 504/501, 304/301, 104/101 for batches 1/10/100/1000; closes bn-3pz failure mode. Process improves vs baseline-gen2 by +10.7% to +153.7% through batch 100, but batch-1000 is -26.9% to -41.6%; report makes no all-cell/85%-of-bare claim. Group 4w improves up to +119.2%. One bare outlier was neutralized by median-of-3. Harness did not persist per-rep load; completion load was 1.89/2.92/5.08."}	blake3:Xu9diLXBQOwwkvnC6eo9CFvyQgL_f9YS-hJBdc1ir7U
1783986886922193	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlgc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Adversarial final review th-27sm9f BLOCKED merge on re-based performance gates: Process 4w b1000 -35.7%/-34.2% vs baseline-gen2 before follow-up optimization, p99 +43.8%/+35.0%, and Group 250B b100 w4 91.2% (<95%); barrier parity passes. Profiling shows large-batch cost is production-only owner work absent from Spike B's prototype (payload ownership/cache publication/index/book). Experimental zero-extra-payload-clone + size-aware cache admission improves 4w b1000 point medians to ~3.20M (24B) and ~2.27M (250B), reducing but not eliminating the baseline regression; it still cannot meet the composed-decision >=1.20x gate without narrowing requirements or moving validation/publication work outside the sole owner (contrary to brief). Awaiting explicit product authority on whether to accept/narrow or reject Step 2."}	blake3:aoAadlQU449eCDdI7oLOuEBjuw9b7-6MVhAk8G9RGJw
1783991151312841	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExlwc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Performance FIX-FIRST resolved in workspace commit 072cc9ef. Asterism-guided large-batch producer preparation keeps sole-owner authority for validation/order/positions/chain/final CRC/write/barrier/publish; cache adopts final framed buffer. Also distinct-type + last-type memoization and query-side metrics snapshots. Final 32-cell AB/BA/AB matrix committed as spikes/baseline_matrix/BN-2SU-FINAL.csv and summarized in BN-2SU-REPORT.md. Process medians: 24B b1000 w4 10.559M ev/s (2.78x Fjall-era, 2.62x matched bare); 250B b1000 w4 6.230M (2.22x Fjall-era, 1.90x bare); 250B b100 w4 3.715M (2.21x Fjall-era). Every Process cell beats baseline-gen2. No Group cell regresses >=10%; formerly blocked 250B b100 w4 is 134,259 (101.6% baseline-gen2), barrier parity intact. Verification: 944/944 non-timing workspace tests pass with documented 25-iteration snapshot-law smoke; release fold_chain_overhead passes at 171ns/event delta; fmt-check and cargo check --workspace --all-targets pass. Reopening cr-2hjzqz."}	blake3:BiGLr2wArqHosYHXp6yhmkotWHpih04TdVzhoVtIWNU
1783992660768167	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExmAc		item.comment	bn-2su	{"body":"Completion verification at workspace HEAD 9e1f52c: adversarial review cr-2hjzqz approved with zero findings/open threads; 944/944 non-timing workspace tests green with MESS_SNAPSHOT_LAW_ITERS=25; prepared/registry/roll/chain/cache/cancellation/direct tests green; fmt-check and all-target check green. Configured just test reproduces the known fold_chain_overhead debug timing flake under parallel load; isolated optimized release passes at 180.7 ns/event. Final fresh-store 32-cell matrix and raw CSV committed; every Process cell beats baseline-gen2 Fjall-era, no Group cell regresses >=10%, D7 barrier parity holds."}	blake3:8CU1arcbfdU6reIrhL1HOe-OFPi9h3cSrlXAiTdwF4w
