1784033438886057	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx-wg		item.comment	bn-o5b	{"body":"GROOM-BONES COMPLETE. Added goal:manual and explicit exit gates to the umbrella and all 8 phases; normalized malformed literal-newline descriptions. Clarified Phase 3 as the pre-v4 bridge needed for Fjall retirement and Phase 9 as the later v4 product/default decision. Changed exact dedupe to an explicit ADMIT/DECLINE product gate. Split oversized v4/endgame/media work into 5 new bones: bn-31f8 v4 performance, bn-1zm0 v4 default policy, bn-37jh final hot-path matrix, bn-2z2j final admission verdict, and bn-32xr FDP/ZNS; narrowed bn-3ew9, bn-2wso, and bn-7n39 accordingly. Strengthened SealPack/v4 follow-up acceptance criteria and corrected Phase 7 effect dependencies. Final shape: 65 roadmap bones = 9 manual goals + 56 tasks/bugs, all tasks M or smaller. Every phase/top plan has zero scheduling violations; bn admin verify/diagnose clean; ready work remains bn-187h, bn-25c, bn-3m3."}	blake3:S7x69o6t5CbkrdINjaUKqw7i9WLJgxfHvnGpnxd1OYQ
