1784041006196698	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExgQk		item.comment	bn-187h	{"body":"Verification complete on synced workspace (base e5acc0bf): fmt-check PASS; 941/942 selected non-snapshot-law correctness tests PASS. Sole failure was soak's 2-crash/80s timing assertion under shared-disk contention (fdatasync p99 262ms, max 734ms); all integrity probes and completed crash/reopen passed. Release chain envelope PASS at 161.2ns/event <=165ns. Bounded real-fs snapshot law PASS 25/25. Authority map committed as acb52c3a; requesting required review."}	blake3:WwMJyGEYDEpRjdkHlY9cpSBjzyOhVLkTlNoFa2ZWr_I
