1784041179863515	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExgwk		item.comment	bn-187h	{"body":"Lead review approved cr-avr6p2 after source cross-checks: the audit accurately identifies FjallSnapshotBackend as the live production consumer, checkpoint/dedupe MetaStore APIs as dormant, and snapshot discovery as discardable acceleration state. Accepted host-contention soak timing failure as non-regression evidence because integrity/reopen probes passed; bounded snapshot law and release chain envelope passed. Downstream roadmap will be rewired before implementation."}	blake3:tuuz_pjSuoyQFYa1oNA4izbXXKffpHen7B022HLpApA
