1784041997267782	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExrAk		item.comment	bn-11mk	{"body":"Reordered from the authority audit: this product decision now precedes conditional dense-slot work in Phase 5. ADMIT creates/activates later integration; DECLINE closes it. It remains independent of Fjall deletion."}	blake3:B4VDuYcZp5Np8ntvKf0NbkDl2CUdnvjhkW_pTy2uE54
1784041997352925	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExrQk		item.comment	bn-ozi5	{"body":"Dependency correction: the chosen discardable snapshot-pack/manifest replacement does not require dense projection slots or SegmentEffect; bn-k8qd remains its contract gate."}	blake3:sDCU6cAsrLmPCxoAwlBHHrbTcpVSPfAa-wYjx7oPE7k
1784042191148418	mess-control-adr	itc:v3:AWKZM-ZOc5kyZEAAAAAAQbW-13drWgAAAAEwBw		item.comment	bn-ozi5	{"body":"Measurement amendment from ADR review: before candidate measurement, commit numeric budgets for save/load hit, forced fallback, reopen p50/p99, peak RSS, write amplification, and files/version. Default paired-median cost ratio <=1.10 with paired 95% bootstrap upper bound <=1.15 unless a different numeric pre-code budget is justified. Warm resident discovery lookup retains p50 <=50ns/p99 <=150ns. Snapshot-off 32-cell gate: Process >=95% current cell, Group >=90%, p99 regression <=10%, no added barriers/syscalls."}	blake3:F1OuytuHBOJr2RpVz5rwZQt013awJsOgBogaJaz36kw
1784042345635778	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExrgk		item.comment	bn-25c	{"body":"Implementation complete in workspace bn-25c at 14352ef. Final verification: just fmt-check PASS; cargo test -p mess-store --test subscription --features mock -- --nocapture PASS (10/10, including [2,4] next() prefetch resume safety, typed CursorRegressed, LogEngine/Mock u64::MAX terminal reads); deterministic workspace nextest excluding the known host-timing envelope and unbounded snapshot law PASS (947/947, 29 skipped, 1 slow); bounded release snapshot law MESS_SNAPSHOT_LAW_ITERS=25 PASS (1/1); git diff --check PASS. Earlier raw just test attempts hit only known/environmental issues: timing-sensitive engine_publish_cancel failed once then passed standalone; chain_append_overhead failed under host load then passed standalone (688.2 ns/event delta); default 3000-iteration snapshot law is intentionally replaced by the prescribed bounded release run. Review blockers addressed: position() accounts for unread next() buffer; StoreError::CursorRegressed validates initial/resumed cursor against published read end; exclusive W1 >p wording; checked/saturating MAX behavior; cancellation docs; mess-log canonical transport layering; durable vs published watermark distinction."}	blake3:SYuVOWPIQYfzr0yjuqWOZUlRM2YKJlKB59LeYhHHzH8
1784042390379817	mess-control-adr	itc:v3:AWKZM-ZOc5kyZEAAAAAAQbW-13drWgAAAAEwCA		item.comment	bn-k8qd	{"body":"ADR/document work complete in workspace. Selected snapshot packs plus compatibility-keyed discardable manifests; projection and exact batch idempotency remain OPTIONAL under bn-11mk/bn-2ctq with conditional authority, encoding, retention, recovery, cursor, allocation-free validation, and A/B constraints. Lead corrections included same-position fold/schema upgrade safety, concurrent old-vs-new publication, retained-manifest GC, warm p50/p99 kill gate, pre-code numeric budgets, and 32-cell tolerances. Checks pass: just fmt-check; git diff --check; source/evidence link assertions; fjall_snapshot 7/7; bounded snapshot law 25/25; social projections 18/18 and snapshots 4/4; CLI doctor_app_snapshots 2/2 and retention_explain 2/2. Roadmap metadata: updated bn-ozi5 description, added bn-k8qd -> bn-2ctq, and annotated bn-11mk/bn-2ctq/bn-1ojm/bn-2hkp plus bn-ozi5 measurement gates. Root grooming separately rewired bn-ozi5 and bn-11mk/bn-1lbf ordering."}	blake3:V2be9KKfBI500oNPlgiOtjalJef4VKC1G9fzuffiKys
1784042418329716	mess-control-adr	itc:v3:AWKZM-ZOc5kyZEAAAAAAQbW-13drWgAAAAEwCQ		item.comment	bn-k8qd	{"body":"Review created: cr-1fcqhq in workspace bn-k8qd (.maw/workspaces/bn-k8qd), assigned @mess-security for risk-high failure-mode review. Commit 62e219d45bc097d393a78d0d2b012d379344c795."}	blake3:DkTHqSsMG2dyzvR8Q9jJgr0P6JwSkciGHKuFXw0DXMs
1784042465609388	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExrwk		item.comment	bn-25c	{"body":"Seal review cr-1ohnxr opened and requested from mess-dev. Source fix commit 14352ef; review-metadata commit e466770. edict protocol review: Needs Review / cr-1ohnxr open. maw merge --check: Ready to merge (trunk 2 commits ahead, absorbable). Workspace clean; no merge/close/claim release performed."}	blake3:yaPdm-l56xiQa_Ii86EIAs51W2rZe3Le0MShuqnook8
1784043035740323	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExsAk		item.comment	bn-25c	{"body":"Independent re-review approved after fixes: safe next() resume position, app-facing CursorRegressed, strict exclusive watermark language, Process-only standard cursor regression, terminal MAX waits, and real/mock boundary tests. Verification: deterministic 947/947 nextest, all-targets check, bounded snapshot law, focused watermark/subscription, fmt, doctests, and diff-check passed."}	blake3:WIIH-0_xRK5kkZLamfYBiWBqNAiOoJCd1Wknsiy2FuU
