1784047270657685	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExwwk		item.comment	bn-2hkp	{"body":"Reconciliation checklist (file/section map): V1 current Fjall/dormant dedupe authority -> README “Current versus target”, research/01 §§2–5, research/13 §§2–8; V2 Book/seal dependency -> design §§2.4, 14, 19(C), research/05 §7; V3 production ActiveIndex reads -> research/01 §§3–4; V4 optional snapshot hashes/current sidecar -> design §§7.3, 15, research/09 §13; V5 registry atomicity plus exact Process/Os/Group current-vs-v4 semantics -> design §§2.3, 5, 17.1, research/04 §§3–5; V6 and S4 one strict RegistryState fold -> design §9.5, research/02 §6. C2 unified A–J ledger -> design §19, research/05 §§1.1,16; C3 v3 extension/R2 ancestry and no dual authority -> design §9.7, research/02 §9; C4 and S7 matched batch-stratified gates -> design §18.1, research/05 §§2,14. D3 exact inclusive dedupe retention -> design §§13.1,13.5, research/03 §7, research/08 R21; D6 cancellation/FIFO byte fairness -> design §§6.5–6.6, research/10 §§2,5. S1 reversible subset -> README Current decision and design §0; S2 early 100M measured run -> design §18.3, research/05 §2; S3 build-parallel/apply-sequential measured rate -> design §§9.8,18.2, research/05 §8; S5 Fjall component floor is not the production thesis -> research/01 §§5–6 and research/05 §2; S6 doctor dedupe precheck retained as historical qualification -> research/06 M6; S8 coverage -> README Integrity manifest coverage plus MANIFEST.sha256. Handoff §6 amendments -> design §§1.1,6.3,9.4,9.7–9.8; research/05 §§1.1,6,8,16; research/09 §§6,19; research/06 historical banner. Four Process/durable frontiers -> design §6.2 and research/10 §2.1. Raw accepted/rejected matrices and reports are directly linked in research/05 §1.1. ADR 0002 capability overlay/current snapshot contract -> README, design §§3,15, research/04 §§2,9, research/13. Review supplements 11/12 are excluded from normative manifest by documented policy and were not edited/copied."}	blake3:4aK-82_bES_KVGj98bBSLXj_RLEg43tpTqsYWrnSTK4
1784047295018464	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxAk		item.comment	bn-2hkp	{"body":"Self-review (risk:low; no new seal review per .agents/edict/review-request.md): verified current-vs-target mode counts against DirectCommitter, ADR 0002 snapshot authority, accepted/rejected spike evidence, all local Markdown links, manifest coverage/hash verification, protected review supplement hashes, and git diff hygiene. Checks: sha256sum -c MANIFEST (14/14 OK); local relative-link check (OK); git diff --check (OK); just fmt-check (OK); isolated fold_chain_overhead rerun (1/1 PASS after one unchanged timing-envelope outlier); bounded snapshot law with MESS_SNAPSHOT_LAW_ITERS=25 (4/4 PASS, law 25/25). Full no-fail-fast suite reached 948 PASS; the only non-interrupt failure was the unchanged timing-only fold-chain envelope, and the default 3000-case snapshot law was deliberately interrupted after 114s then replaced by the bounded green run."}	blake3:5QoGqx-eo-noIKNPk_DrnZ_DPjcDrWgPlUnmeT9lnT4
1784048321704777	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExxQk		item.comment	bn-2hkp	{"body":"Reviewer evidence for cr-2kayb5 (commits 71956ee5 + bfc39c54): residual 1 fixed in research/08 R8/detail plus design §§18.1/18.5/21.8 and research/05 §§6/14 — 1.20x is explicitly the passed historical pre-flat-owner gate; forward Phase 4 uses prelocked BN-2SU-FINAL per-cell throughput/p99/barrier budgets, predeclared tolerances, and committed raw matrices. Residual 2 fixed in research/07 §§1/4 — no-store/no-migration state, operational rollback/canonical replay only, and exact batch idempotency optional under bn-2ctq/ADR 0002. Residual 3 fixed in design §4 and research/08 §7 — research13/ADR classification is complete; bn-3l8n remains the application/offline-tool adoption gate. Residual 4 fixed in README Current versus target and research/13 §§1/critical path/bn-3l8n, plus matching design §§0/2.1/4 — snapshot discovery is the only live Fjall-backed state role/blocker, while CLI metaread/doctor/inspect/retention and rebuild-index --meta are named direct operational consumers. Validation: MANIFEST 14/14; local Markdown links pass; stale-phrase scan pass; git diff --check pass; just fmt-check pass; workspace clean. Protected root research/11 and 12 hashes remain 0879b5de... and 27b637e1... . Fresh docs/design review created: cr-2kayb5 in workspace bn-2hkp, reviewer @mess-design."}	blake3:5hBd0-zs-mHDqG_ZQp3s056yp0TyWXQw0Q7T5ZroTu8
