1784059541776071	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx7wk		item.comment	bn-3eg0	{"body":"Before second-redesign code edits, late-owner-ticket policy and focused causal gates were frozen in commit 9993616. Prepared requests: FIFO prep-pool wait/lease before allocation, no owner ticket until immutable PreparedBatch/retained shape is complete, then unchanged strict FIFO combined owner byte+count admission; prep lease survives synchronous transfer. Owner-ready rather than async-call ordering is normative; pre-readiness overtaking is intentionally unbounded in cumulative count but bounded in instantaneous memory. Next study: mixed-only A=75970e6 early ticket vs B late ticket, exact A,B,B,A,A,B, 3/side, no retries/queue-only/extra cells, load1<6, frozen hashes. Gates: B tiny p99<=124872ns and <=90% A; tiny throughput>=8242 and >=95%A; near p99<=111253621 and <=110%A; wall<=121.27395ms and <=105%A; exact prep HWM4/251660304, owner<=64MiB, zero current/leaks/cancel/bypass/starvation, exact heads. No build/test/benchmark until source/static audit checkpoint."}	blake3:JxifDLOGajsWL-hTwDWeVTD74ZJywlA2xOCx8ixeQRQ
1784060510612411	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx8Ak		item.comment	bn-3eg0	{"body":"Late-owner-ticket source checkpoint complete. Policy/gates were committed before code at 9993616; implementation committed at b199e78. Prepared requests now take a separate monotone FIFO preparation ticket/turn and byte lease before any owned input construction, build the complete immutable retained shape without an owner ticket, then call the unchanged strict FIFO combined owner byte+count admission; prep lease transfers/releases only after synchronous MPSC send. Added separate prep-wait current/HWM count+bytes, latency, wait cancellation, FIFO bypass, and starvation metrics/public docs. Updated finite model to distinct prep-arrival/owner-ready orders with cancellation/close/full release; added deterministic production tests for tiny overtaking blocked builders, no post-readiness bypass, both same-stream winner orders, registry/type-name resolution plus reopen, prep FIFO/no prebuild owner ticket, and close/cancel phases. Harness supports explicit --mixed-only and reports both FIFO domains. Normative design 6.2/6.5/6.6, R22, formal 5.3, and locked perf gates updated; research 11/12 untouched; failed evidence preserved. Static-only checks: cargo +nightly fmt --all --check PASS and git diff --check PASS. Worktree clean. Per instruction, no build, cargo check, test, harness invocation, benchmark, or performance row has run."}	blake3:s6oIz7kKUsJo_IaIXp1rbzNPoOGhD2v41nJKlq20Ajs
1784060700425600	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx8Qk		item.comment	bn-3eg0	{"body":"Late-ticket checkpoint validation for b199e786 is GREEN; no fixes or new commit needed. Exact debug/focused evidence: (1) cargo test -p mess-store --lib owner_ring_model_tests -- --nocapture => 15 passed, 0 failed, 41 filtered; covers prep FIFO vs owner-ready FIFO, tiny overtake blocking, post-ready no-bypass, preparation/owner cancellation and close phases, same-stream readiness-order winner, single type-name resolution plus reopen, count/byte/oversize bounds. (2) cargo test -p mess-store --test engine_owner_ring -- --nocapture => 2 passed, 0 failed; includes four-near-limit exact HWM/bounds and oversize rejection. (3) cargo test -p mess-store --test engine_publish_cancel -- --nocapture => 2 passed, 0 failed. (4) cargo test -p mess-store --lib owner_outcome_scratch_tests -- --nocapture => 1 passed, 0 failed, 55 filtered. (5) cargo test -p mess-store --test engine_metrics metrics_move_under_durable_workload -- --exact --nocapture => 1 passed, 0 failed, 2 filtered; direct-owner/outcome-scratch metrics integration. Total focused: 21 passed, 0 failed. Static: cargo check --workspace --all-targets PASS; just fmt-check PASS. Workspace HEAD b199e786 is clean. Per grant, no release harness build, mixed study, full suite, or review was run."}	blake3:niZ97P8ffFMO7FJPDBdKbLoAvQQjQHE9DBW61pPeGvA
