1784063185722399	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAEx_Ak		item.comment	bn-3eg0	{"body":"Attempt4 isolated-core proposal committed at 971ed7bce41143e7f05a8f599220db08f099771d; NOT run and no binary build/invocation. One-time variant-independent 10s /proc/stat survey selected the three least-busy full SMT pairs 8+20=11.501%, 7+19=12.227%, 6+18=13.086%; frozen cpuset 6,7,8,18,19,20 and TOKIO_WORKER_THREADS=6 match the harness six workers. Survey-derived pre-variant guard thresholds are aggregate busy<=15% and each pair<=20% over 5s; global load recorded but not gated. Guard SHA256 811061f144b659b21dd815ee03bd85cc19c4fc1b2e16f50d84c6f733d1d7f5a9. Fixture runner SHA256 15e570a7888469fb1dd3d592a0591db70f69d26c0100e4b092f6db28833ade66; bash parse and fixtures pass: observed-regime 11.5/12/13% aggregate12.167 status0; pair21% with aggregate13.667 status4; aggregate16% with pairs16 status4; missing/nonnumeric parser status3; cargo process status5. Same frozen binaries/order/gates, no prior rows, any guard miss stops/no retry. Candidate clean; control preserved clean/unmerged. No build/harness process live."}	blake3:awXcD5Ra8vnJqJ0Dq0UWJlfFwh4I_DkrfUOFShkjgmA
