1784128494596175	mess-dev	itc:v3:AWKTOcmSTM5M8lAAAAAAQa3darbreoAAAAExjgo		item.create	bn-5mc9	{"description":"Supersede rejected bn-3vj4 checkpoint 35fb/Attempt8 without weakening its gates. Stage 1 correctness: make one authoritative public frontier across head/read_stream/read_global/total_events/subscription watermark; add an exact pause between ActiveIndex staging/release and notification to falsify split visibility. Stage 2 diagnosis: add low-perturbation owner phase/group-width/close-reason counters and run matched ABBA Process b1, Process b100, Group b1000. Stage 3 bounded optimization: publish minimal metadata once, then perform correctness-transparent cache warm plus completion in plan order after the cut (completion still implies cache warm), preserving cancellation/error precedence and exact one-transition tests. Focused gates remain throughput >=97%, p99 <=110%, allocations/bytes <=105%, Group aggregate barriers <=100.25% and median delta <=0. Only after focused pass rerun the full 160-row EventStore->FjallSnapshotBackend->LogEngine matrix. If focused gates miss, decline standalone cutover and move the contract behind dense-head/microblock composition.","kind":"task","title":"Prove one canonical publication frontier and remove post-I/O group staging"}	blake3:mMFGvUvKD2K4Gcc6MWrtqMIWIQj__2z9L4hnoGIwm7g
